--------------------------------------------------------------
 Bitmap Heap Scan on foo (actual rows=3 loops=1)
   Recheck Cond: (bar = ANY ('{365,366,368}'::integer[]))
   Heap Blocks: exact=1
   Buffers: shared hit=4
   ->  Bitmap Index Scan on skippy (actual rows=3 loops=1)
         Index Cond: (bar = ANY ('{365,366,368}'::integer[]))
         Buffers: shared hit=3
(7 rows)

